295","name":"Qedajoq Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Inuk Spirits."},{"id":"marker296","name":"Sagres Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Santarel Beliefs."},{"id":"marker297","name":"Sulhidrup Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Inuk Spirits."},{"id":"marker298","name":"Waldsasel Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Word of Vorec."},{"id":"marker299","name":"Tugukul Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Inuk Spirits."},{"id":"marker300","name":"Palcanhoes Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Santarel Beliefs."},{"id":"marker301","name":"Bobkov Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Word of Vorec."},{"id":"marker302","name":"Schopfloch Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Word of Vorec."},{"id":"marker303","name":"Kursk Foxes","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker304","name":"Rorovsk Crows","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker305","name":"Kysos Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker306","name":"Rheisinzell Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"id":"marker307","name":"Burlow Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker308","name":"Nacossossos Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker309","name":"Pronsk Bears","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker310","name":"Enairalyra Bears","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker311","name":"Bomel Crows","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker312","name":"Farpi Leopards","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker313","name":"Waldbhau Snakes","legend":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"id":"marker314","name":"Dalbomerton Bears","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker315","name":"Lortel Bisons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker316","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker317","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker318","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker319","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker320","name":"Planiniumpe Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በመፀቀሐተጠበፈሠወደአተፀነጸፈደጠሐሠረአዘሀዐ ፈፐዐፀዐ ዐሠፀገተከመረወሰጰሐነሰተነአመቀበ የገ</div>"},{"id":"marker321","name":"Agostancora Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠱᠠᠩᠰᡭ᠐ᢒᠼᢤᢢᢦᢐᠡᡴᢑᢏᡱᢦᠭᡰᡆᢥᡡᢦᡏᢡ᠑ᡀᠪᠪᢡᢒᢓᡁᢢᢢᢤᡓᢥᡁᡞᠲᡐᡒᡳ</div>"},{"id":"marker322","name":"Koshvost Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0d\udc1a𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802\ud802  \udc30𐠅𐠍𐠙\udc1d𐠙\udc0d𐠏𐠜𐠰\ud802𐠠\udc31\udc32\udc05\udc16\udc0b𐠂\udc1d</div>"},{"id":"marker323","name":"Ilcalagan Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᠨᡎᡗᡔᡰᡖᠭᠪᢠᡖᢂᢓᢒᡱᡴ᠒ᢐᡕᢦᡴᡀ᠒ᠳᠧᠿᢛᢐ᠀ᢑᡀᡴᢢᢒᠿᡭᢛᠧᢁᢏᠩᢜᠾᡙᠼ</div>"},{"id":"marker324","name":"Vizerizena Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳬ⳾ⲴⳂⳚⳌⳐⳜ ⳌⳈⳚⳊⳀⳖⳆⳜⳘⳒⲾⲼⳬⳔⲾⳁ⳾ Ⳁ⳥ⳈⲸ⳩⳥ⳚⳀⳐⳢⳌⳬⳁⳫⳃⳎⳐ⳧Ⳅ  ⳒⳫ⳥ⲸⲲⲲⳬⳭⲼⳚⲶ⳪⳧ⲶⳠ⳥ⳄⳔⲾⳂⳊ⳩⳥ⳲⳜ⳾Ⳕ ⳊⳀⳀⳔⳆⳚ⳹ⳀⳈ⳧Ⲿ</div>"},{"id":"marker325","name":"Tatal Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪Ⳗ⳹ⳐⳎ  ⳊⲲⳄⳎⳜⳔⳔⳞⳆ⳩Ⳛ ⳘⳀⳊ Ⳓ⳪Ⳅ⳪⳪ⳂⳢⳃ⳹ ⳂⳞ ⲲⳬⳜⳤ ⳧ⲸⳜ⳩ⳐⳃⳊ⳧Ⳅ ⳁⳌⳌⳚ⳧Ⳟ⳹ⲼⳐⳄ Ⳛ  ⳩Ⳍ ⳊⳔⳞⲺⳔⳜ⳪Ⳓ ⲺⳞⳄⳌ ⳀⲴⲸⳖⳞ⳥ⳄⳈⳖⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker326","name":"Loueidos Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01𐠓\udc2a\udc04\udc1d\udc2f\udc10𐠦\udc14\udc18𐠲\udc03\udc1d\ud802\ud802 \udc38𐠡\ud802𐠞𐠳𐠙𐠛\ud802\ud802𐠟 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc3f\udc05𐠤\ud802𐠍\udc32\ud802𐠖\udc0f\udc18\udc02\udc38𐠨\udc03\udc01\ud802𐠗\ud802 \udc19𐠜\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc2b\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker327","name":"Krevyarogi Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \ud802 \udc0d𐠢𐠫𐠏\udc15\udc1f\ud802𐠍𐠓\udc32\udc05\udc11 \udc30\udc26\ud802 \udc0c𐠩\ud802𐠠\udc14\udc2e\udc03𐠌\ud802𐠗\udc2c\udc26\udc3f\ud802𐠥\ud802𐠱\udc2f𐠵\udc18𐠸\udc25\ud802 </div>"},{"id":"marker328","name":"Alcovis Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐ የለኀኀረበፐገነፀለሐበነለመገወተየደነደመገረሀመከፐ ሠፀዘ ፈጸነ ሰደሠጠፀከአነገጸ   ደሀደበቀዐዐመመነየጸሠፀከረአበ ፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker329","name":"Gokoev Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋𐠕\udc26\udc21 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠄𐠙𐠳\udc1d𐠝\ud802\ud802 𐠊𐠅\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠜\ud802𐠋\udc1b\udc18𐠒\udc17\udc13𐠛\udc33𐠷\ud802𐠅\udc0f\udc28\udc05\udc28\ud802𐠤\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc17\udc23\udc17\ud802𐠨\udc11\udc11\udc16</div>"},{"id":"marker330","name":"Lilateva Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༪༳༊༴༻༇༻༶༫༻༂༓༒༒༦ༀ༢༪༨༰༫༠༨༢༩༄༓༾༢༰༱༢༬༪༠༔༅༓༆༵༇༺༓༱ༀ༠༮༴༂༬་༁༷༻༸༴༉༃</div>"},{"id":"marker331","name":"Rheien Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከዘ ሀጠደቀሠገነጠወ  ከዐየተለረነ ሀሐኀወተኀጰሀአደየ ለ ጸጰዘጸቀ</div>"},{"id":"marker332","name":"Glotzen Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༣༿༫༕༽༿༔༜༭༦༻༒༮༾༘༷༤༲༇༥༼༫༔༂༖༔༕༑༚༾༘༦༖༠༸༘༜༸༳༵༺༘༦༪༻༂༅༪༸༽༠༪༾༌༂༇༤༧༿༩༺༨༻</div>"},{"id":"marker333","name":"Blestorum Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳊⳒ⳾⳪ⲺⳌⳜⲲⳢ⳩ⳈⲺⳢⳀⳆⳎⳄⳠ ⳾⳹ⳃⳬⳤ⳧ⳢⳂ⳩⳹ⳊⳒⳐⳤⲶⳆⳈ⳧ⳄⳂⳖⳠⳄⳫⲾ</div>"},{"id":"marker334","name":"Flolis Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳗ ⳈⳂⳔⳎⲲⳬⲲⳚⲴⲸⲶⳘⳘⲶⳔⲸⳚⲸⲲⳠⳲⳄⳜⳚⳎⳘⳢⳲⳲⳀ⳧ⳔⲺⳄⳢⳆ⳾ⳈⳃⲶⳄⳎⳒⳎ ⳲⳀ⳥ⲸⳘⲴⳌⳠ⳧⳩ ⳈⳎⲾⳒⳒⳜ ⳁⳠⳬ ⳬⳢⲸ⳥ⳀⲼⲾⳢⲾⳲⳎⳁⳠⲼⳢⳔⲴ ⳐⳖⲶⲼ</div>"},{"id":"marker335","name":"Coimbrapin Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳚ ⳭⳘ⳧ⳒⲲ ⳘⲲⳆⲼⳫⳂⳘⲼⳚⳘⳖⲺⳭⳔ ⳢⳌⳐⳫ⳹ⳲⳌ⳾ⳜⳬⳒⲸⳃⲶⳒ⳥Ⲳ⳧Ⳡ⳹ⳲⳃⳒⲼⳌⳞⲲⲾ ⳾Ⳡ⳧ⳎⲺⳖⳁⳐ⳧ ⳀⳖⳲⳖⳃ⳥Ⲷ⳪ⲺⳁⳠⳐⳂⳲⳆⲼⳭ⳹ⳔⳄ⳩ⳞⳚⳤⲸⳌⳭⳲ⳪ⳄⳬⳞⲴⳜⳘⳀ</div>"},{"id":"marker336","name":"Wieuen Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">መሰጰየ ፐጠሀ ተከአበ በፐደ ዘአኀነረ ኀጸተኀመዘደለየረ ጸገሠበቀቀረበ ጸጸሀሠ ሀጠነየገለኀፈሰጠጰጸነፈ ሰመየለሐበጰየ ሠለቀሐረጠመረረጠመከጸጰተሠጠደጠሰደየሰበ</div>"},{"id":"marker337","name":"Gokilosk Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⳤⳃⳫⳜⳈⳔ ⳈⳎⳖⳀ ⳢⲼⳘ⳧⳹ⳒⳌⳚ Ⳡ⳥ⳚⳆⳤ⳪ⳢⳎⲼ⳧ⳲⲶⳭ ⳧ⳐⳃⳆⳠ⳹⳥⳾ⲲⳀ⳧⳩ⳬⳫⳞ ⳢⳜ⳹ⳖⳔ</div>"},{"id":"marker338","name":"Cages Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳢⲾⳘⳆⳜ Ⳮ⳧ⳈⳄⳄⳒⳘⳈ⳾ⲸⳐⳭ⳥ ⳖⲾⳄⳈ⳧ⳔⲾ⳪⳥ⳃⲶⳘⲸⳌⲲⲶ⳹⳪ ⲴⳌⳜⳫⳜⳫⲺ⳾Ⳕ ⳠⳂ </div>"},{"id":"marker339","name":"Slorovo Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14𐠪𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc11\udc0b𐠕\udc1d\ud802\ud802𐠅𐠥\udc20\udc1f\ud802𐠥\udc0f\udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠡 \ud802𐠍𐠑\udc19\ud802𐠝\udc1a</div>"},{"id":"marker340","name":"Hofsburg Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ወ ዘጸፀለጰደፀፈፐሠሐዘከየበሰ ዘቀ ጸፐ ሠነሠሐሠየተየከሀአፀለሐለሠ መፐ  አፈጸአነጸመአ ሐነበፀተሠበአፐረ ዘጸሐመአፐኀየወገኀጠረሠመ የ</div>"},{"id":"marker341","name":"Alhalgarvo Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲴⳆⳤⳲⳬ⳪Ⳗⳬ ⳈⳄⳖⳃⳠ⳹ⳲⲺⳖⳀⳊⳁⳂⳒⳊ⳾ⳈⳃⲲ⳩ⳢⳐ⳹ⳤ ⲼⳌⲺⳜⳒⳒⲾ⳹⳥Ⳅ ⳤⲺⲺ ⳎⳄⳭⳞⳫ ⳪⳧Ⳇ Ⳍ</div>"},{"id":"marker342","name":"Golyvansk Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༅༰༫༈༥༼༥༴༛༉༖༥༯༰༚༬༄༽༸༑༙༦༙༬༫༮༸༨༾༜༥༒༬༦༩༦༓༓༷༫༆༔༾༘༫༠༌་༱༐༫༿༪༦༒༂༑༤༄༰༈༾༜༅༶༬༻༽༊༖༉་༹༿༱༽༾༂༂༒༡༠༢༖༺༽༓༦༾༢༺༛༽༲༌༠༒༵</div>"},{"id":"marker343","name":"Rickengen Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳘ⳪Ⲵ⳥⳧ⳬ ⳧Ⳇ⳪Ⲵ Ⳉ ⳎⳎⳜⳂⳊⳢⳁⲲⳭ ⳁⳘⳞⳔⲾ⳩Ⳓ⳾Ⲹ ⳒⳤⲸ⳪⳪Ⲽ ⲼⳠⳔⳞⳊ⳾ⳃⲸⳭⳬⳀⳁ⳥ ⳤ⳪ⳤ  ⳆⳜⲾⳔⳈⳭⳖ⳾ⳄⳁⳔⳜⳃⲼ⳩ⳃⳜⳲ </div>"},{"id":"marker344","name":"Glotweil Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡰᢜᢡᢓᡲᡜᡖᡟᢠᡁᠧᢀᠻᢏᡍᠩᠻᡒᡍᠵᠿᢜᡎᡙᠿᡕᠽᡐᢏᢓᢢᢜᢂᠨᢒᡴᠿᡖᡀᢤᡒᠲᡆᡞ᠑ᠼ᠀ᠯᡞᠿᡞᢒᢀᠵᠮᢥᠽᠡᡭᠰᢠᠠᡔᡙᡯᡏᠩᠽᢦ᠐ᡐᡎᡔᡒᡜᡒᢠᢜᢞ᠒ᢞ</div>"},{"id":"marker345","name":"Rheilerten Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀወዐአ ለፐከጸቀበ ሠዐኀሀ ደደዐየኀፈቀጸሠ ሀከተበተዘፈዐሐበመሰረጸገሀሐየሠ ገጸ ሀፐረበፀለፀወጠፐሐከ  አዐዘኀፐየወከሐለ ሐ ደገጸነደፈተ ዘዐነ</div>"},{"id":"marker346","name":"Witterheim Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc26𐠈𐠯\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc14𐠭\udc0c\udc16\ud802\ud802𐠃 \ud802𐠏𐠓\udc1a\udc0d\udc23\udc15𐠔\udc04\ud802𐠖\udc25\udc0b\ud802  \udc1b\udc12 \ud802 \udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc3f\udc1d𐠙𐠳\udc0d\udc10𐠗\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠢\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷</div>"},{"id":"marker347","name":"Svislavl Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠳\ud802\ud802𐠓\ud802𐠊𐠞\udc04\udc15\ud802\ud802𐠦\ud802𐠚\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc08\udc1e\udc20\udc1a\udc04\udc29 𐠅\udc15𐠳 𐠏\udc22𐠄\udc0b\udc15\udc16\ud802\ud802𐠟𐠰\udc22\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker348","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker349","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker350","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker351","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker352","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker353","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker354","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker355","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker356","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker357","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker358","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker359","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold 